      "node_id": "kg_doc_4",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Siân Gibson (born Siân Foulkes; 15 July 1976) is a Welsh actress and writer perhaps best known for her collaborations with Peter Kay, including starring in and co-writing the comedy series \"Peter Kay's Car Share\", for which she won the 2016 BAFTA TV Award for Best Scripted Comedy and the National Television Award for Best Comedy.",
